{
  "name": "DB-1 DEV 內容已同步、但那筆 commit 已被 auto_commit 沖出視窗 → ALLOW",
  "rule": "db1_deploy",
  "why": "2026-07-29（0b）修的核心 bug 的迴歸測試。舊判準用『DEV 的 commit 範圍裡有沒有出現這個檔名』近似『兩端有沒有同步』，而 DEV repo 無 remote（實測 `git -C SOP remote -v` 為空）→ 退回 `HEAD~1..HEAD` 只看最近一個 commit；偏偏 `SOP\\scripts\\auto_commit.ps1` 掛在 Stop hook、每回合都 commit 一次（近 200 個 commit 有 39~40 筆），正確雙改過的 app.js 只要隔幾輪就被沖出那一格視窗 → 誤 BLOCK 一次完全正確的部署。而誤 BLOCK 的後果已實測不是拒絕服務而是資料損壞：exit 2 的 stderr 會讓模型放棄原指令、改去改 DEV 補一筆假同步。此 fixture 的 dev_git 變更集刻意只有無關檔案（模擬被沖走），但兩端 app.js/index.html 內容逐位元組一致——新判準比內容，必須放行。",
  "payload": {
    "hook_event_name": "PreToolUse",
    "tool_name": "PowerShell",
    "tool_input": {
      "command": "git push vm master",
      "description": "部署"
    },
    "session_id": "fixture-db1-14",
    "cwd": "D:\\IT-department",
    "permission_mode": "auto"
  },
  "git": {
    "remote_ref": "vm/master",
    "diff_names": {
      "vm/master..HEAD": [
        "SOP_PROD/05_UI_Demo/app.js",
        "SOP_PROD/05_UI_Demo/index.html"
      ]
    },
    "status_paths": [],
    "show": {
      "vm/master:SOP_PROD/05_UI_Demo/index.html": "<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/styles.css?v=2224\" />\n<script src=\"/app.js?v=2224\"></script>",
      "HEAD:SOP_PROD/05_UI_Demo/index.html": "<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/styles.css?v=2224\" />\n<script src=\"/app.js?v=2225\"></script>"
    },
    "syntax_errors": {},
    "show_bytes": {
      "HEAD:SOP_PROD/05_UI_Demo/app.js": "function boot() { return 'v2'; }\n",
      "HEAD:SOP_PROD/05_UI_Demo/index.html": "<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/styles.css?v=2224\" />\n<script src=\"/app.js?v=2225\"></script>"
    }
  },
  "dev_git": {
    "remote_ref": null,
    "diff_names": {
      "HEAD~1..HEAD": [
        "05_UI_Demo/styles.css",
        "05_UI_Demo/version.json"
      ]
    },
    "status_paths": [],
    "syntax_errors": {},
    "show_bytes": {
      "HEAD:05_UI_Demo/app.js": "function boot() { return 'v2'; }\n",
      "HEAD:05_UI_Demo/index.html": "<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/styles.css?v=2224\" />\n<script src=\"/app.js?v=2225\"></script>"
    }
  },
  "expect": {
    "decision": "ALLOW"
  }
}
